ving up to  buy a yellow immunity band illegally for  sarah so they can get out of the city to  live a life of their own although buying  such bans illegally is considered a  punishable offense nico is willing to  risk it all for the love of his life in  the next scene we are introduced to a  famous female singer mae who is doing  one of her live sessions as she is  taking song requests from her fans a  disabled war veteran michael dozer who  also happens to work for lester as a  drone operator tips her 100 and messages  her he mentions that her songs helped  him during his time in the war this  touches may and she sings a motivational  song for him after the session mae calls  dozer and inquires about his war  experiences as dozer explains everything  in detail the two develop a special bond  between them on the other hand nico  visits sarah's apartment and delivers  her a packet of pencils as she loves to  sketch he also gives her a letter where  he has written a funny poem for her  later at night while sarah and nico are  video chatting on their phones lita  approaches sarah and informs her that  she is feeling sick expectedly she  becomes scared but nico assures her that  he will arrive there soon just then the  sanitation department knocks at her door  outside the head of the sanitation  department harlan finds a man who has  escaped from the queue zone and stabs  him to death as sarah prepares for the  worst harland arrives outside the door  and tells his men that they have come to  the wrong door following this the crew  enters a nearby apartment and forcefully  drags a patient out to the queue zone at  the same time nico takes out his  motorbike and rushes to sarah's  apartment after arriving he consoles  sarah by mentioning that everything will  be fine however she requests that he go  back as they might get into trouble if  they are caught despite this nico  insists on keeping an eye on sarah from  outside the door when she finally agrees  the two spend the whole night talking  about their special moments on the other  hand piper's husband william is  preparing to leave the house late at  night surprisingly when he approaches  the door he is confronted by his wife  who asks him where he is going william  says that he has a meeting but piper is  skeptical about that still she lets him  leave but not before telling him to burn  his clothes before he re-enters the  house in the next scene william arrives  at may's residence and the two have some  fun together william is a piece of [ __ ]  after the happy hour william returns to  his home and as urged by his wife burns  his clothes before entering the house  the next day while nico is still  sleeping at her doorstep sarah goes to  leeda for their regular virus checkup at  first she gets herself checked and comes  out clean free of virus but  unfortunately when she does a scan on  lita the application detects some virus  and suggests li to be taken to the  quarantine zone nico also gets to know  about this and tries to persuade sarah  to escape with him however sarah refuses  the request and tells him that she  cannot leave lita in this condition and  go away she also tells him that this  might be their last meeting as the  sanitation forces will arrive any time  soon nico is devastated hearing all this  but he still doesn't want to give up he  informs sarah that he will get some  immunity passes anyhow and leaves the  building following this he makes a call  to lester and asks him if he can manage  two immunity passes for sarah and her  grandmother lester tells him that he  does not have any passes but knows  someone who can arrange them he then  tells nico about the griffin family who  are the immunity past dealers in the  city in the next scene nico arrives at  the griffin residence and talks with  william about the passes hearing this  the griffins are shocked as they wonder  how a commoner knows about their secret  they tell nico that they don't deal in  such illicit things but the latter  starts begging with no options left  piper tells nico that she has run out of  the bands but she does know someone who  stores them in abundance she then hands  him an address and tells him to reach  the place as soon as possible in the  next scene nico arrives at the given  address and enters an abandoned building  to meet the dealer while he is roaming  around the place he is greeted by  harland disguised as an immunity banned  contractor he tries to extract  information about the girl for whom nico  is trying to get the band with harland  continuously asking for some personal  information about the girl nico gets  suspicious and halts from providing him  with further information this enrages  harland and he stabs nico with a  pocketknife but the latter hits him back  and somehow manages to escape from the  place elsewhere as sarah goes to check  on lita she finds her dead devastated  she immediately calls nico and briefs  him on the situation with time running  out nico dresses his wounds and suggests  sarah hides somewhere when the  sanitation department arrives to take  lida's body away on the other hand mae  is talking with dozer and telling him  everything about griffin and his illegal  immunity band business she also tells  him that griffin is using her to fulfill  his desires and that she can no longer  tolerate him hearing this dozer suggests  she be bold and confront the guy rather  than being suppressed by him in the  meantime may gets a message from william  mentioning that he wants to meet her  again at night this time may declines  his request and tells him that  everything between them is over seeing  the messages william becomes mad and  immediately calls may he berates her for  being an immoral person but may counters  by blackmailing him saying that she'll  reveal his illicit business if he  doesn't stop calling her she then cuts  the call short leaving william worried  and stressed as he should be  surprisingly the entire 