e puts her belongings inside  her car and tries to start it but fails  just then william arrives and threatens  her to get out of the car when she does  not comply he breaks the car door and  grabs her by her neck luckily dozer  manages to locate the duo and using his  sniping skills he shoots william dead  with the drone and saves may god damn  dozer goes hard meanwhile sarah who  tried to escape wearing the hazmat suit  is captured by harland and his crew  although she has yet to develop any  symptoms of coronavirus she is forced to  go to the q zone after some time niko  arrives at sarah's apartment and becomes  worried when he can't find her  surprisingly he is then confronted by  harland who is waiting there for his  arrival he tries to attack nico again  with his pocket knife but this time nico  picks up sarah's sketch pencil and stabs  him on his neck harlan loses a lot of  blood and dies on the spot that ought to  teach him to get a bigger knife while  leaving the apartment nico comes upon  sarah's mobile phone and finds a picture  of the sanitation department vehicle in  which she is being transported to the q  zone he then immediately calls lester  and asks him to locate the vehicle in  turn lester calls dozer and urges him to  find the vehicle lester is lazy with  lester and dozer connected to him on his  mobile phone nico takes out his bike and  drives around the place after some time  dozer spots the sanitation vehicle and  informs nico about the location  desperate to save sarah nico speeds up  to the place and manages to arrive there  before sarah is taken inside the q zone  the police officers try to stop nico but  he somehow manages to come near sarah  and secretly hand her the yellow  immunity bracelet following this the  officers apprehend nico but when they  notice the yellow armbands on the duo  they decide to scan them after a  thorough checkup both nico and sarah are  found to be immune and hence they are  released in the next scene the couple  finally embrace each other for the first  time in their lives just then sarah  reveals that she is also immune like him  she also mentions that the only reason  she didn't get out of her apartment was  because she feared for her grandmother's  life although nico is shocked he  understands her situation and forgives  her in the final scene of the movie  piper and may team up and frame william  and harland as the ones behind the  illegal wristband sales dozer and may  start dating virtually while nico and  sarah are traveling up the pacific coast  highway the movie ends with lester  receiving an immunity bracelet sent to  him by nico as a gift for helping him  out in the toughest of times subscribe  for more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

